--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Qwen3 chat template
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/genie_server.py renders Qwen3's tool-calling chat template by hand
(the server is stdlib-only and cannot run Jinja). The preamble strings, the
tag names and their ordering are reproduced verbatim from the Qwen3 model
bundle's own tokenizer_config.json chat_template.

Qwen3 is Copyright (c) Alibaba Cloud, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. No Qwen3 weights, tokenizer files or bundle artifacts are
distributed with this repository.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Qualcomm QAIRT / Genie API declarations
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/genie_server.py declares a small set of constants, enum values and
ctypes function signatures for Qualcomm's Genie C API, derived from the
published headers (include/Genie/GenieDialog.h, GenieCommon.h, GenieSampler.h
and GenieTokenizer.h) in the QAIRT SDK. These are interoperability declarations reimplemented in
Python so that this program can call the library; no Qualcomm source code,
object code, header file or other SDK material is included or redistributed
here. The QAIRT SDK is obtained separately by the user, directly from
Qualcomm, under Qualcomm's own license terms.

